  "body": "https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/pull/2899 changed the name of this AO; pulling that in here.\n\nApologies for the churn, but the previous name really was quite confusing.\n\nIncidentally, I note that the second argument, which is a spec-internal enum value \"key\", is marked up as if it were a variable name. That seems potentially confusing. Is there better markup which could be used here? Ecma262 uses a monospace font for enum values.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8283/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 12, 2022, 8:45 PM UTC (183ca86)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8283/469b353...183ca86/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 12, 2022, 8:45 PM UTC (183ca86)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8283/structured-data.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 12, 2022, 8:45 PM UTC (183ca86)\">/structured-data.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8283/469b353...183ca86/structured-data.html\" title=\"Last updated on Sep 12, 2022, 8:45 PM UTC (183ca86)\">diff</a> )",
